  "description": "<p>This mod synchronizes door states for all players on raid start.</p>\n<hr />\n<h3>Installation</h3>\n<p>Applicable to the <strong>server host</strong>, <em>all</em> <strong>clients</strong>, and <strong>headless</strong> <em>if available</em>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Install <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/820/door-randomizer\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Door Randomizer</a></li>\n<li>Extract the contents of the .zip archive into your SPT-Fika folders</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3N6gTe2.gif\" alt=\"Installation\" />\nThank you <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/user/27605/drakiaxyz\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">DrakiaXYZ</a> for the gif</p>\n<hr />\n<p>If you enjoy my work, you can <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/ozenm\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">buy me a coffee</a> ☕</p>\n",
